      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SECRET LINE (1) produced a strong performance at his latest appearance when he came from this barrier and dug deep to score by a head at this circuit and distance. Should enjoy a nice run again. Leading hope. ANGELIC ATTITUDE (2) continued her good form when she came from the back row and finished second here last start, beaten 3 metres. Won four of her previous five outings, two of them here. Aided by a low draw so she can give this a real shake. BELIEVE IN DREAMS (5) has been solid from the back row of late including a second after working here two back. Won the last two times he started on this row, one of those coming at this venue. TOTALLY STUNNING (7) owns a good second-up record so is is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win when coming from this barrier to score by 2.8 metres at Shepparton.",
